{"4071650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stream Train", "steam_appid": 4071650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Livestream your experience exploring an abandoned railroad with your friends in the hopes of going viral. Investigate derelict buildings, document strange creatures, and prank your friends to keep the audience engaged in the stream because you won’t make it through the <i>Uncanny Valley</i> without their support and donations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/b1cbe11d9767c2461384d76e5acd7d8e.poster.avif?t=1788270922\" aria-label=\"The player picks up a camera item which reveals a streaming UI. Other players pose for the camera.\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/b1cbe11d9767c2461384d76e5acd7d8e.webm?t=1788270922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/b1cbe11d9767c2461384d76e5acd7d8e.mp4?t=1788270922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep Chat Happy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chatters will react to whatever they see on the livestream, pose challenges, and make requests. They will also tell you when they are bored. If you keep the content flowing, chatters will keep the donations flowing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/7fb19d5280fddaad91ae28d183c86cc0.poster.avif?t=1788270922\" aria-label=\"The player films different interesting objects around the world.\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/7fb19d5280fddaad91ae28d183c86cc0.webm?t=1788270922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/7fb19d5280fddaad91ae28d183c86cc0.mp4?t=1788270922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All Aboard!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of an old steam train and explore the <i>Uncanny Valley</i> at your own pace. Up to 6 players can squad up, customise their avatar, and head out in search of internet virality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/a8ab830a01b7cc529f4de42ff3ce87ba.poster.avif?t=1788270922\" aria-label=\"The player uses the train controls, pulls the steam whistle, disengages the break, then activates the throttle.\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/a8ab830a01b7cc529f4de42ff3ce87ba.webm?t=1788270922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/a8ab830a01b7cc529f4de42ff3ce87ba.mp4?t=1788270922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't Die</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All sorts of cryptids, ghosts, and strange creatures can be found in the forest. Try not to make them angry or at least film it when you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/58bd192a7d373ce3cd996b6f79695b4e.poster.avif?t=1788270922\" aria-label=\"The player sees a monster standing close to them, after a second, the monsters eyes turn red and it dives towards the player.\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/58bd192a7d373ce3cd996b6f79695b4e.webm?t=1788270922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/58bd192a7d373ce3cd996b6f79695b4e.mp4?t=1788270922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Livestream your experience exploring an abandoned railroad with your friends in the hopes of going viral. Investigate derelict buildings, document strange creatures, and prank your friends to keep the audience engaged in the stream because you won’t make it through the <i>Uncanny Valley</i> without their support and donations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/b1cbe11d9767c2461384d76e5acd7d8e.poster.avif?t=1788270922\" aria-label=\"The player picks up a camera item which reveals a streaming UI. Other players pose for the camera.\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/b1cbe11d9767c2461384d76e5acd7d8e.webm?t=1788270922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/b1cbe11d9767c2461384d76e5acd7d8e.mp4?t=1788270922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep Chat Happy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chatters will react to whatever they see on the livestream, pose challenges, and make requests. They will also tell you when they are bored. If you keep the content flowing, chatters will keep the donations flowing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/7fb19d5280fddaad91ae28d183c86cc0.poster.avif?t=1788270922\" aria-label=\"The player films different interesting objects around the world.\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/7fb19d5280fddaad91ae28d183c86cc0.webm?t=1788270922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/7fb19d5280fddaad91ae28d183c86cc0.mp4?t=1788270922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All Aboard!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of an old steam train and explore the <i>Uncanny Valley</i> at your own pace. Up to 6 players can squad up, customise their avatar, and head out in search of internet virality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/a8ab830a01b7cc529f4de42ff3ce87ba.poster.avif?t=1788270922\" aria-label=\"The player uses the train controls, pulls the steam whistle, disengages the break, then activates the throttle.\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/a8ab830a01b7cc529f4de42ff3ce87ba.webm?t=1788270922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/a8ab830a01b7cc529f4de42ff3ce87ba.mp4?t=1788270922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't Die</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All sorts of cryptids, ghosts, and strange creatures can be found in the forest. Try not to make them angry or at least film it when you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/58bd192a7d373ce3cd996b6f79695b4e.poster.avif?t=1788270922\" aria-label=\"The player sees a monster standing close to them, after a second, the monsters eyes turn red and it dives towards the player.\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/58bd192a7d373ce3cd996b6f79695b4e.webm?t=1788270922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/extras/58bd192a7d373ce3cd996b6f79695b4e.mp4?t=1788270922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Stream Train is a co-op adventure where up to 6 players livestream their trip through the Uncanny Valley. Grow your audience by taunting cryptid creatures, doing dangerous stunts, and pranking your friends. Can you make it through the valley alive?", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/87e00de4862f3ba5392506c8f34c752f0b7ce8df/header.jpg?t=1788270922", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/5fb815aebb105ad174c723113b81d1d915a50f7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788270922", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071650/5fb815aebb105ad174c723113b81d1d915a50f7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788270922", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 @ 2.5 GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 G